commit 0dc9220d48b2194bf71b8f2cc53c712667ec5cb0
Author: cracki <cracki@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 15:03:00 2026 +0330

    fix(qa4-N1,qa4-new3,qa4-taza1): scan error detail, rescan refill, progress retry
    
    - N1: BrandCreateView normalizes the scan error body (legacy bare array
      or {detail}) and shows the backend reason verbatim instead of the
      generic 'Website scan failed' (BrandCreateView.vue:196-209).
    - new3 (FE half): rescan updates scan-filled fields - scanFilledFields
      tracks which fields the scan filled; shouldFill applies when the field
      is empty OR scan-filled, user edits still always win
      (BrandCreateView.vue:214-243).
    - taza1: retryAnalysis starts the new run, resets the tracker,
      invalidates the stale single-run query keys and router.replace()s to
      the new run uuid so the bar restarts instead of sticking on the old
      run's 'Website scan' (queries.ts:88-113, BrandAnalysisView.vue:94-150);
      sectionStuckGuard flags sections running >12 attempts and shows a
      'still processing' hint while polling continues (sectionProgress.ts:107-137).
    - BrandCreateView.test.ts 17 (5 new), BrandAnalysisView.test.ts 4 (2 new),
      sectionProgress.test.ts +3.

